  "Figure 7.3: Visual Canvas Builder — Triggers, If/Else conditions, Wait timers, and Email actions": "चित्र ७.৩: विजुअल कैनवास बिल्डर — ट्रिगर, If/Else शर्तें, प्रतीक्षा टाइमर और ईमेल क्रियाएं",
  "Available Node Types:": "उपलब्ध नोड प्रकार:",
  "Triggers:": "ट्रिगर्स:",
  "WooCommerce Cart Abandoned, Order Completed, New Subscriber, Lead Finder Prospect Enrolled.": "WooCommerce Cart Abandoned, Order Completed, New Subscriber, Lead Finder Prospect Enrolled।",
